{"user_row":3279,"user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","business_row":2338,"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","nv_rank":306,"mm_rank":361,"nv_score":0.6400889754295349,"mm_score":0.5645184516906738,"rank_movement":-55,"has_visual_feature":true,"name":"Mona's Cafe","address":"3901 Banks St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70119","stars":4.0,"review_count":202,"categories":["Middle Eastern","Restaurants","Ethnic Grocery","Food","International Grocery"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":306,"mm_rank":361,"target_category_support_fraction":0.4,"selected_image_count":3,"label_diversity":3,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Middle Eastern","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Ethnic Grocery","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"International Grocery","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","review_id":"i-kTN786VoDikFS4xAvw0g","date":"2015-09-02T18:41:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9497865438461304,"text_excerpt":"Mona's is my favorite of the Middle Eastern restaurants in town or as I call them -\"the hummus restaurants.\" Like Tex-Mex, there is one menu that appears in all of these restaurants, but some do it better than others. Mona's is my go-to place, especially the one on Banks St which I think is the original. Today for lunch I had the gyro/chicken shwarma combo plate which includes a nice sized and tasting salad and hummus along with some pita. It was a bargain at $13.99. You can't go wrong here."},{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","review_id":"KkSgse1bsIzJ6bmdsLRT9w","date":"2011-10-25T17:38:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9433555603027344,"text_excerpt":"I've been a fan of Mona's for years now although I usually visit the one on Carolton and in the days before Katrina the one on Calhoun. Thankfully the Banks location provides the same tasty menu and good service. Personally I'm a fan of the falafel sandwich, kibby with lebna, and the every popular lamb with hummus. And don't forget a glass of Lebanese tea to wash it down. One of the nice things at this location is the spacious patio seating, which is great during the cooler weather of Fall. Oh, and after you're done, you can stop by the small grocery they keep right next door."},{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","review_id":"Sc8XDg2g0vpTDFvxHu0v_w","date":"2012-06-26T18:44:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415634870529175,"text_excerpt":"I love Mona's and this is a nice location (there are 3 of them, I think). Anyway, I had the vegetarian platter, which is a lot of food for $10. I ate the falafel, hummus, and pita. I boxed the tabouli and baba ganoush and had that the next day. All was quite nice, especially the falafel. That was the best falafel I've had. The iced mint tea is a perfect summer drink, too. Oh, the service was excellent as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","photo_id":"si1nmzrqKHzDwbmuoBWzGw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/si1nmzrqKHzDwbmuoBWzGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9103624820709229},{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","photo_id":"QxZB4bN7j3J_wrx1NWOqSQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QxZB4bN7j3J_wrx1NWOqSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8712737560272217},{"business_id":"vvOzblHBA2HHsCb7CMSDbQ","photo_id":"dScyUGbX4r0yiyQZfjlQYw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dScyUGbX4r0yiyQZfjlQYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8194550275802612}]},"notebook_case":null}
